return` preferred form.\n\n``` javascript\n/**\n * @return {Number}\n */\nfunction foo() {\n    return 1;\n};\n\n/**\n * @returns {Number}\n */\nfunction bar() {\n    return 2;\n};\n\n/**\n * No return tag.\n */\nfunction bar() {\n    return 2;\n};\n```\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"rules\": {\n    \"valid-jsdoc\": [2, {\n        \"prefer\": { \"return\": \"return\" }, \n        \"requireParamDescription\": false,\n        \"requireReturnDescription\": false,\n        \"requireReturn\": false\n    }]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOnly one error is trigger with same config as above: \n\n```\n15:1   error    Missing JSDoc @returns for function  valid-jsdoc\n```\n\nThe `@returns` tag line 9 should also trigger an error.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/4238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/4238/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":449791408,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQ0OTc5MTQwOA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/449791408","actor":{"login":"lizardruss","id":727952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzk1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/727952?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss","html_url":"https://github.com/lizardruss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizardruss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lizard